    placement: all centers on unique rows and unique columns; no two plus shapes share cells (min Chebyshev distance between centers >= 3); arms may touch grid edge (min arm-to-edge distance >= 0)
    only_foreground: every non-bg pixel in input belongs to exactly one plus shape
